<title>UK: Coats Viyella climbs on Courtaulds news.</title>
<headline>Coats Viyella climbs on Courtaulds news.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in UK textiles group Coats Viyella Plc climbed after rival Courtaulds Textiles forecast stronger profits for the second half of 1996.</p>
<p>The shares added 5-1/2p or 4.03 percent to 142p by 0905 GMT on renewed bullish sentiment in the sector.</p>
<p>Courtaulds Textiles said earlier on Friday that its UK clothing businesses had performed better than expected and said that second half profits should show an improvement over the previous year.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
</text>
